{"title":"Virikh Lord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 56 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">Skeleton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(47)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a> <span class=\"muted\">(53)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/f51c05cc107f81db045a.svg\" alt=\"Virikh Lord\"></div><h3>Virikh Lord</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>56</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Skeleton</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n 